 "remarks": "A hidden Silvermine retreat on a picturesque cul-de-sac, this privately sited home offers the rare luxury of feeling completely removed from the world, while remaining close to everything. Set amid mature trees and flowering gardens on a lush, level .6-acre property with electric fence. The setting is both serene and inviting, with generous open lawns and enchanting koi pond. Inside, sunlight and architectural drama take center stage. The sleek, sun-filled kitchen features a center island, eat-in area, abundant counter space, and direct access to the deck. Just beyond lies the spectacular two-story living room-with soaring vaulted ceilings, an impressive hearth, french doors and open catwalk, all of which creates an unforgettable backdrop for both intimate evenings and stylish entertaining. The upper level offers two bedrooms and two full baths, including a spacious primary suite with new Berber-style carpeting and an entire wall of closets. The above-grade walk-out lower level provides exceptional flexibility, featuring a room currently used as an unofficial third bedroom with closet and two forms of egress, a glass-enclosed sunroom overlooking the backyard, a recreation/music room with fireplace, laundry room, and half bath. An oversized two-car garage with dedicated work area completes the home. Private. Architectural. Unexpected. A Silvermine sanctuary for those who want the feeling of an escape without sacrificing convenience. 1 hour to NYC, 15 mins to beaches!",
